# Docker build context is the repo root (see backend/Dockerfile).
# Keep the context small, and keep secrets out of the image.

**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.local
.git
.github

# Build output and caches — rebuilt inside the image.
**/out
**/cache
**/.next
backend/sandbox-template/lib
contracts/out
contracts/cache

# Nothing the backend needs at runtime.
frontend
arkiv
**/*.md
!backend/README.md
